// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - LargeShard 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3076319292" "Large shard of Serafina's crystal"
// DetailString :
"P2928740169" "Before reporting of Archus' demise to Ice Mistral, you carved this large chunk from Serafina's crystal. It's all you can take with you for now, but at least some portion of Serafina's power has become yours."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - EpisodeOneClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1752730217" "The Crystal of Serafina"
// DetailString :
"P3283407391" "It began with a visit to Ice Mistral, Scirocco's most trusted subordinate. Her master was seeking an item of great power: the crystal of Serafina. And Ice Mistral wanted you to retrieve it.  You defeated the Circle mystics Ice Mistral sent you after, but you recovered only a shard of the original crystal. "

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - EpisodeTwoClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DetailString :
"P3619056721" "It began with a visit to Ice Mistral, Scirocco's most trusted subordinate. Her master was seeking an item of great power: the crystal of Serafina. And Ice Mistral wanted you to retrieve it.  You defeated the Circle mystics Ice Mistral sent you after, but you recovered only a shard of the original crystal. <br><br>Ice Mistral wasn't satisfied. You had to find the remainder of the crystal, or face the consequences. You took to the streets and interrogated all the Circle mages you could find, until one of them mentioned some sort of network in Sharkhead. You journeyed there, and found that the Circle had scattered large pink crystals throughout the area. You tore a swath through them, but learned nothing more."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - EpisodeThreeClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DetailString :
"P3645503488" "It began with a visit to Ice Mistral, Scirocco's most trusted subordinate. Her master was seeking an item of great power: the crystal of Serafina. And Ice Mistral wanted you to retrieve it.  You defeated the Circle mystics Ice Mistral sent you after, but you recovered only a shard of the original crystal. <br><br>Ice Mistral wasn't satisfied. You had to find the remainder of the crystal, or face the consequences. You took to the streets and interrogated all the Circle mages you could find, until one of them mentioned some sort of network in Sharkhead. You journeyed there, and found that the Circle had scattered large pink crystals throughout the area. You tore a swath through them, but learned nothing more. <br><br>Despite your skills, the Circle network was growing. Scirocco sensed a build up of the crystals in Primeva, and you went there. You destroyed a number of pink Circle of Thorns crystals. It was clear that the Circle's network of crystals was exerting some sort of power over other beings; you had to wade through a swath of Devouring Earth to get to the Circle mage running the operation. In his robes you found another shard of Serafina's crystal. "

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - EpisodeFourClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DetailString :
"P3031894244" "It began with a visit to Ice Mistral, Scirocco's most trusted subordinate. Her master was seeking an item of great power: the crystal of Serafina. And Ice Mistral wanted you to retrieve it.  You defeated the Circle mystics Ice Mistral sent you after, but you recovered only a shard of the original crystal. <br><br>Ice Mistral wasn't satisfied. You had to find the remainder of the crystal, or face the consequences. You took to the streets and interrogated all the Circle mages you could find, until one of them mentioned some sort of network in Sharkhead. You journeyed there, and found that the Circle had scattered large pink crystals throughout the area. You tore a swath through them, but learned nothing more. <br><br>Despite your skills, the Circle network was growing. Scirocco sensed a build up of the crystals in Primeva, and you went there. You destroyed a number of pink Circle of Thorns crystals. It was clear that the Circle's network of crystals was exerting some sort of power over other beings; you had to wade through a swath of Devouring Earth to get to the Circle mage running the operation. In his robes you found another shard of Serafina's crystal. <br><br>The next portion of the network Scirocco sensed was in Nerva. It was aboard a cargo ship, and was guarded by a group of Tsoo. It seemed that the Tsoo were being psychically controlled through the network of crystals. You defeated the network's protectors, and brought a sample of the crystals back to Ice Mistral. "

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - EpisodeFiveClue 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// DetailString :
"P1831672416" "It began with a visit to Ice Mistral, Scirocco's most trusted subordinate. Her master was seeking an item of great power: the crystal of Serafina. And Ice Mistral wanted you to retrieve it.  You defeated the Circle mystics Ice Mistral sent you after, but you recovered only a shard of the original crystal. <br><br>Ice Mistral wasn't satisfied. You had to find the remainder of the crystal, or face the consequences. You took to the streets and interrogated all the Circle mages you could find, until one of them mentioned some sort of network in Sharkhead. You journeyed there, and found that the Circle had scattered large pink crystals throughout the area. You tore a swath through them, but learned nothing more. <br><br>Despite your skills, the Circle network was growing. Scirocco sensed a build up of the crystals in Primeva, and you went there. You destroyed a number of pink Circle of Thorns crystals. It was clear that the Circle's network of crystals was exerting some sort of power over other beings; you had to wade through a swath of Devouring Earth to get to the Circle mage running the operation. In his robes you found another shard of Serafina's crystal. <br><br>The next portion of the network Scirocco sensed was in Nerva. It was aboard a cargo ship, and was guarded by a group of Tsoo. It seemed that the Tsoo were being psychically controlled through the network of crystals. You defeated the network's protectors, and brought a sample of the crystals back to Ice Mistral. <br><br>Ice Mistral had the crystal fragments examined, and the news was startling: these crystals were being grown from the crystal of Serafina. It seemed the Circle of Thorns was building a vast network capable of mentally controlling everyone in the Rogue Isles. Using the psionic crystals as the medium and Serafina's crystal as the power source, they were nearing the completion of their plan. "

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// SouvenirClueDef - SL7_CrystalOfSerafina_StrikeForce 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// tDetailString :
"P4147970447" "Nobody knows you kept this large shard of crystal, taken from the Circle mystic Archus. It's a powerful artifact, but it's also a reminder of the time you tracked down: <br><br>The Crystal of Serafina <br><br>It began with a visit to Ice Mistral, Scirocco's most trusted subordinate. Her master was seeking an item of great power: the crystal of Serafina. And Ice Mistral wanted you to retrieve it.  You defeated the Circle mystics Ice Mistral sent you after, but you recovered only a shard of the original crystal. <br><br>Ice Mistral wasn't satisfied. You had to find the remainder of the crystal, or face the consequences. You took to the streets and interrogated all the Circle mages you could find, until one of them mentioned some sort of network in Sharkhead. You journeyed there, and found that the Circle had scattered large pink crystals throughout the area. You tore a swath through them, but learned nothing more. <br><br>Despite your skills, the Circle network was growing. Scirocco sensed a build up of the crystals in Primeva, and you went there. You destroyed a number of pink Circle of Thorns crystals. It was clear that the Circle's network of crystals was exerting some sort of power over other beings; you had to wade through a swath of Devouring Earth to get to the Circle mage running the operation. In his robes you found another shard of Serafina's crystal. <br><br>The next portion of the network Scirocco sensed was in Nerva. It was aboard a cargo ship, and was guarded by a group of Tsoo. It seemed that the Tsoo were being psychically controlled through the network of crystals. You defeated the network's protectors, and brought a sample of the crystals back to Ice Mistral. <br><br>Ice Mistral had the crystal fragments examined, and the news was startling: these crystals were being grown from the crystal of Serafina. It seemed the Circle of Thorns was building a vast network capable of mentally controlling everyone in the Rogue Isles. Using the psionic crystals as the medium and Serafina's crystal as the power source, they were nearing the completion of their plan. <br><br>It was time to take the fight to the source: the Circle mage Archus. Sciroccco's fine senses told you to look for a vast build up of brystals somewhere in Primeva. You went there and defeated Archus for good, winning the crystal of Serafina back for Arachnos. Of course, no one needs to know that you've kept a portion of it."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2528683177" "So you're here. Looking for favor from my master, Scirocco, I suppose. Well, I suspect it'll be easy to earn. All he wants is a crystal, one belonging to the genie, Serafina. It's currently being held by the Circle of Thorns.<A HREF={ACCEPT}> Bring that crystal here, and Scirocco will smile on you.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1937413720" "Bring the crystal of Serafina to Ice Mistral"
// SendOffString :
"P863561122" "Scirocco is far too trusting, {TaskForceName}. I am not. You haven't earned my faith just yet, and to do it you'll need to do more than treasure hunt. <br><br>Prove yourself to me by unleashing your fury upon the Circle mages. I have had far too much experience with arrogant mystics who believe they know what is best for the world. After all, it was the Monks of the Four Winds who made me what I am, and they have since had cause to regret it."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1784577030" "Defeat all mages in temple"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2425612895" "Scirocco wants that crystal, {TaskForceName}. And I want those mages dead."

