"P2794921198" "I have information for you, {TaskForceName}. I have had those crystal fragments you brought me analyzed. It seems that they are being grown from the crystal of Serafina! believe the Circle is building a vast psychic network, bent on controlling everyone within the Rogue Isles, possibly the world. You and I cannot have that, {VillainName}. And so you must do what you can to stop it. If Scirocco's senses are accurate, their is a great buildup pf psionic crystals in St. Martial. there, and destroy them!"
// AcceptString :
"P354852225" "Destroy the crystals"
// SendOffString :
"P2911118289" "I believe these crystals the Circle are using have been grown from the shards of Serafina's crystal. Recover the whole, and you may stop them entirely."
