"P692602356" "Scirocco has sensed a vast amount of vibrations coming from a cavern in Primeva. It could well be that this is Archus' lair. I want you to find that Circle archmage, and I want you to wring his neck for me. If they even have necks under those cowls. Heh. If you find any sign of the crystal of Serafina, bring it back to me."
